"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What are some unique Agouti names?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"For unique Agouti names 🐹, consider fantasy-inspired options, names from foreign languages, or creative invented combinations. Our Fantasy Names and Unique Names categories feature one-of-a-kind options drawn from mythology, literature, and pure imagination. You can also draw inspiration from your favorite books, movies, or video games!\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Should my Agouti's name be easy to pronounce?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes! Choose a name that is easy for you and your family to say consistently 🐹. Avoid names that sound too similar to common commands (like \\\"Kit\\\" for \\\"Sit\\\"). A clear, distinct name helps your Agouti recognize when you are calling them and strengthens training effectiveness.\"}}]}14:[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"BreadcrumbList\\\",\\\"itemListElement\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":1,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Home\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://bestanimalnames.com/\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":2,\\\"name\\\":\\\"All Animals\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://bestanimalnames.com/animals/\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":3,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Agouti Names\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://bestanimalnames.com/animal/agouti/\\\"}]}\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$1d\"}}],[\"$\",\"nav\",null,{\"className\":\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-3 text-sm text-gray-500 flex gap-1 flex-wrap\",\"aria-label\":\"Breadcrumb\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"href\":\"/\",\"className\":\"hover:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Home\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"/\"}],[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"href\":\"/animals/\",\"className\":\"hov